WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:03.954
F3.1 · Importing a general ledger

2
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:08.431
The general ledger is the base of FP&A.

3
00:00:08.481 --> 00:00:12.054
Statements, KPIs and the forecast all start from it.

4
00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:17.492
Each line needs an entity, a date, an account and its amount.

5
00:00:17.542 --> 00:00:21.298
Third party and business unit are optional, and worth having.

6
00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:27.247
Before importing, open the file and check it.

7
00:00:27.297 --> 00:00:30.526
Size is not the problem; inconsistency is.

8
00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:37.901
Once the ledger is right, the statements build themselves.

9
00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.944
Next: F3.2  Accounting connectors

